{"id":"marea","lemma":"marea","pos":"noun","rank":3674,"glosses":["tide"],"ipa":"/maˈɾea/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mareas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-marea.wav","examples":[{"text":"La marea está subiendo.","en":"The tide is coming in.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58194","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to go up or come up","l":"subir"}]},{"text":"Contra viento y marea consiguió lo que quería.","en":"He got what he wanted against all odds.","words":[{"g":"antidote"},{"g":"wind"},{"g":"and"},null,{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},null,null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"¿Te mareas a menudo si te levantas rápidamente de la cama?","en":"Do you often become dizzy if you get up from bed quickly?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null,null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to lift","l":"levantar"},{"g":"rapidly, quickly"},null,null,{"g":"bed"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"often, oftentimes"],[8,10,"of the"]]},{"text":"Las mareas se producen por la gravedad de la luna.","en":"Tides are caused by the moon's gravity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606596","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to produce","l":"producir"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"seriousness, severity"},null,null,{"g":"moon"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"of the"]]}]}